<div style="max-width:780px;margin:0 auto;padding:60px 20px;">
  <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0;">

    <div style="display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:flex-start;padding:28px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #efefef;">
      <div style="min-width:44px;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:#1a1a1a;color:#fff;font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">📦</div>
      <div style="padding-top:8px;"><strong>Return Policy</strong><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;">We accept returns within 14 days of delivery. Items must be unused, unopened, and in their original packaging. To initiate a return, contact us at <a href="mailto:info@nichey.store" style="color:#1a1a1a;">info@nichey.store</a> with your order number.</span></div>
    </div>

    <div style="display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:flex-start;padding:28px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #efefef;">
      <div style="min-width:44px;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:#1a1a1a;color:#fff;font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">🔄</div>
      <div style="padding-top:8px;"><strong>Exchange Policy</strong><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;">If you received the wrong item or would like a different variant, we're happy to arrange an exchange within 14 days of delivery. Contact us and we'll guide you through the process.</span></div>
    </div>

    <div style="display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:flex-start;padding:28px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #efefef;">
      <div style="min-width:44px;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:#1a1a1a;color:#fff;font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">💳</div>
      <div style="padding-top:8px;"><strong>Refund Process</strong><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;">Once we receive and inspect the returned item, your refund will be processed within 5–7 business days. The amount will be returned to your original payment method.</span></div>
    </div>

    <div style="display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:flex-start;padding:28px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #efefef;">
      <div style="min-width:44px;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:#1a1a1a;color:#fff;font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">❌</div>
      <div style="padding-top:8px;"><strong>Non-Returnable Items</strong><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;">For hygiene reasons, the following items cannot be returned: opened skincare or beauty products, items without original packaging, and gift cards.</span></div>
    </div>

    <div style="display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:flex-start;padding:28px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #efefef;">
      <div style="min-width:44px;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:#1a1a1a;color:#fff;font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">😟</div>
      <div style="padding-top:8px;"><strong>Damaged or Wrong Item</strong><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;">We're so sorry! Please contact us within 48 hours of receiving your order at <a href="mailto:info@nichey.store" style="color:#1a1a1a;">info@nichey.store</a> with photos of the item and your order number. We'll resolve this immediately at no cost to you.</span></div>
    </div>

    <div style="display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:flex-start;padding:28px 0;">
      <div style="min-width:44px;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:#1a1a1a;color:#fff;font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">📧</div>
      <div style="padding-top:8px;"><strong>How to Start a Return</strong><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;">Email us at <a href="mailto:info@nichey.store" style="color:#1a1a1a;">info@nichey.store</a> with your order number and reason for return. Our team will respond within 24 hours with next steps.</span></div>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

